  "question": {
    "text": "Two wires that are made up of two different materials whose specific resistances are in the ratio <math><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn></math> , length <math><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn></math> and area <math><mn>4</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>5</mn></math>. If the ratio of their resistance is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;then what is the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;are the smallest positive integers.?"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "13",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Use <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
